            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Pain is a complex notion which caregivers must be able to decipher. Its aspects vary depending on the patient's condition. In cases of verbal communication disorders, the subjectivity of the caregiver is enlisted. How should pain be assessed in situations of coma and how should it be treated?</AbstractText>
